{"root":{"data":{"id":"dn5piedz1000","created":1795753563476,"text":"聚类","font-weight":"bold"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5pk7mexsw0","created":1795753705478,"text":"聚类任务"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5pkerv8qo0","created":1795753721045,"text":"任务"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5pklfgze80","created":1795753735533,"text":"将训练集划分为若干簇，簇的对应概念事先未知"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn5pki9rcqo0","created":1795753728657,"text":"区分"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5pkokd2740","created":1795753742359,"text":"分类是有监督，已知类别；聚类是无监督，没有标签，挖掘数据内在分组结构。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn5pkao6py80","created":1795753712115,"text":"性能度量"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5pkto92s00","created":1795753753478,"text":"外部指标"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5pl0ulj540","created":1795753769099,"text":"有参考标准答案，和真实簇划分对比"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn5pl8826cg0","created":1795753785151,"text":"Jaccard系数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5plvaj1hs0","created":1795753835366,"text":"衡量两个集合相似度，越大越好"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn5plb4lafs0","created":1795753791471,"text":"FM指数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5plye33w80","created":1795753842111,"text":"匹配度，取值[0,1]，越大聚类效果越好"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn5plf5pc6o0","created":1795753800246,"text":"Rand指数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5pm1hhso00","created":1795753848848,"text":"样本对划分一致性，取值[0,1]，越大越好"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn5pkxr60r40","created":1795753762361,"text":"内部指标"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5pl46uxdk0","created":1795753776371,"text":"没有参考，仅基于样本簇内/簇间距离评估"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn5plijybqo0","created":1795753807637,"text":"DB指数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5pm6j3iw00","created":1795753859829,"text":"计算每个簇内平均距离、簇中心之间距离，值越小越好"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn5plnsgc680","created":1795753819035,"text":"Dunn指数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5pm9n0m000","created":1795753866596,"text":"最小簇间距离/最大簇内距离，值越大越好"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn5pmfogos00","created":1795753879744,"text":"距离计算"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5pmjcgofk0","created":1795753887726,"text":"距离用来衡量样本相似度"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn5pmn1km000","created":1795753895774,"text":"闵可夫斯基距离"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5pmvz4dls0","created":1795753915217,"text":"p=1：曼哈顿距离"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn5pn6dd4s00","created":1795753937846,"text":"p=2：欧氏距离"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn5pnbcc6140","created":1795753948668,"text":"p→∞：切比雪夫距离"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn5pnj8dvpc0","created":1795753965843,"text":"有序属性（连续数值）使用闵可夫斯基距离"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn5pnmivpy00","created":1795753973008,"text":"无序属性（离散类别）使用VDM距离。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn5pnqhdwtc0","created":1795753981625,"text":"混合属性"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5pnuc1l1s0","created":1795753990009,"text":"既有有序又有无序，将闵可夫斯基和VDM结合"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn5pnza7u7c0","created":1795754000782,"text":"特性"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5po28csag0","created":1795754007200,"text":"非负性：两个样本间距离大于等于0。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn5po28cie00","created":1795754007200,"text":"同一性：两个样本无论在哪个维度都相等时距离为0。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn5po28cn7k0","created":1795754007200,"text":"对称性：公式对称，两个样本谁先谁后计算都一样。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn5po28cp0g0","created":1795754007200,"text":"三角不等式：直线距离最短也叫欧式距离，中间途经任何一个样本距离之和都比欧式距离长。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn5po6qhnow0","created":1795754017004,"text":"原型聚类"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5pobgijzk0","created":1795754027285,"text":"核心思想"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5poesppnk0","created":1795754034553,"text":"假设每个簇存在一个原型代表该簇，把样本分配到最近原型对应的簇"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn5poj86m2o0","created":1795754044195,"text":"目标"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5pomtm61s0","created":1795754052021,"text":"最小化簇内平方误差"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn5q8lcm7uo0","created":1795755616100,"text":"k‑均值"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5poqg6akg0","created":1795754059916,"text":"算法流程"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5pou682zk0","created":1795754068021,"text":"指定簇数k，随机选k个样本作为初始均值；"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn5pou67ods0","created":1795754068021,"text":"每个样本划分到距离最近均值的簇；"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn5pou67t0w0","created":1795754068021,"text":"更新每个簇的均值向量；"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn5pou684800","created":1795754068021,"text":"迭代直到均值不再变化。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn5q85936yw0","created":1795755581058,"text":"缺点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5q8ap28bc0","created":1795755592908,"text":"对初始k、初始中心点敏感；容易收敛到局部最优；适合球状簇"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn5q8xcg5x40","created":1795755642211,"text":"学习向量量化LVQ"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5q927ewwg0","created":1795755652791,"text":"关键点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5q957elk80","created":1795755659321,"text":"虽然是聚类算法，但需要样本标签。学习一组原型向量，每个原型带类别标签，迭代更新原型向量，使得同类样本靠近原型，异类远离。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn5q9daozv40","created":1795755676934,"text":"高斯混合模型GMM"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5q9hnca1s0","created":1795755686405,"text":"假设全部数据由k个多元高斯分布混合生成；每个高斯对应一个簇"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn5q9mrr8c80","created":1795755697556,"text":"使用EM算法求解：E步根据当前模型计算样本属于各个高斯成分的后验；M步更新高斯均值、协方差、混合系数。属于软聚类：样本给出属于每个簇的概率，不是硬划分。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn5q9uqqgps0","created":1795755714909,"text":"密度聚类"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5qa70hdh40","created":1795755741620,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn5q9zapojc0","created":1795755724824,"text":"簇是高密度连通区域，不需要预先指定簇的数量。代表算法DBSCAN"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn5q9zaphgg0","created":1795755724824,"text":"概念定义：ϵ邻域、核心对象、密度直达、密度可达、密度相连。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn5q9zaq1k80","created":1795755724825,"text":"流程：找出全部核心对象；从核心对象出发，把密度可达样本生成簇；不属于任何簇的点标记噪声点。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn5q9zaq9l40","created":1795755724825,"text":"优点：能处理不规则形状簇、自动发现簇数量、抗噪声；缺点：对ϵ、邻域点数MinPts 参数敏感，高维数据距离失效。"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}